Search and discover entities in the code graph

Usage:
  eshu find [command]

Available Commands:
  argument    Find functions with a parameter name
  content     Full-text search in source content
  decorator   Find functions with a decorator
  name        Exact-name search
  pattern     Substring search
  type        List all nodes of one type
  variable    Find variables by name

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for find

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization

Use "eshu find [command] --help" for more information about a command.
